{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmyuUuGXaW5zbhQQcUbu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll stop here. The rest is a word list (\"מונחים\"), and I'm tired.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\n\"Listen, I think I understand it now, more or less. A קרן השתלמות is a savings fund. The employer puts in up to 7.5% of the salary and I put in at least a third of what they put in, up to 2.5%. After 6 years you can take the money out and pay no tax on the profit. It's not locked, you can take it out earlier, but then you pay tax, and there was an orange box saying it's 'אפשרית, אבל יקרה' (possible, but expensive). Is it worth having? It looks like yes. The employer gives money I wouldn't get otherwise. But I'm only fairly sure, and I'll ask you, or the clerk at the bank, which company and which מסלול to choose. That part I didn't understand at all.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- The heading and the first section \"מה זה\". It was clear: savings, employer and me, 6 years, no tax.\n- \"למה משתמשים בזה\" says the employer's deposit only comes if you join.\n- \"מה מייחד\": suddenly \"S&P 500\" and \"מדד\" and a graph with yellow and green bars, 17,370 ₪ against 16,955 ₪. I didn't understand what it was comparing. Then a lot of numbers in small print, and one of them had a minus, \"−342.02 ₪\". That worried me, so I went on.\n- \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\": big, clear boxes. \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\" (once 6 years have passed), \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\" (up to 4 business days). That's what I came for.\n- \"כמה זה עולה\": \"עד 2% בשנה\" (up to 2% a year), and no exit fee (\"דמי יציאה – אין\").\n- \"מיסוי\", then the orange box about early withdrawal, then \"סיכונים\". The money is kept separately from the company's money, and the State does not guarantee its value.\n- I stopped at \"מונחים\", the word list.\n\n**What I skipped:** \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\", \"הצגת החברות\", \"כל החברות\", the \"השוואה\" links and everything under the word list.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** S&P 500, מדד in the sense they use it, מסלול כללי, אג\"ח צמודה / לא צמודה, מזומן שקלי, דמי נאמן, \"הרווח הריאלי\", ותק, TXH-09 / KH-15 / PF-18, and the dotted underlines under the numbers. The grey lines under the comparison and the grey line under the cost table were too pale to read.\n\n**What bothered me:** Next to almost every paragraph and box there's the same little \"חוקים וכללים · 4\" (rules and regulations). I read it again and again and never knew what it means. On the dark background the grey writing barely shows. The comparison has too many numbers, and there's a minus. There's also a sliding marker on the graph, and I don't touch those."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3569,"cache_read_input_tokens":14805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3569},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08603f19-fd5c-483d-b6f8-438a202f1a53","uuid":"b544ee24-e389-452d-8e36-be9befceb0c4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:22:26.887Z","request_id":"req_011CgmyuUfPCmEq8Ekks1XLp"}
